{"title":"Scholar Athlete Milk Mustache of the Year (SAMMY) Award","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirements\">Requirements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Scholar_Athlete_Milk_Mustache_of_the_Year_(SAMMY)_Award&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Requirements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Must demonstrate excellence in athletics (35% of evaluation)</li>\n<li>Must demonstrate excellence in academics (35% of evaluation)</li>\n<li>Must hold at least one leadership position (15% of evaluation)</li>\n<li>Must be involved in community service (10% of evaluation)</li>\n<li>Must drink milk (5% of evaluation)</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://malcolmscholars.blogspot.com/2010_02_01_archive.html\">Source</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Amount\">Amount</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Scholar_Athlete_Milk_Mustache_of_the_Year_(SAMMY)_Award&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Amount\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Winners receive a &lt;dollar/&gt;7,500 college scholarship, an appearance in a special Milk Mustache ad in USA Today, and a special awards weekend in June with the chance to meet Milk Mustache celebrities (all-star athletes).\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>For more information, check out the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.bodybymilk.com/sammy_scholarship.php\">website</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Scholar_Athlete_Milk_Mustache_of_the_Year_(SAMMY)_Award&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=National_scholarships\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"National scholarships\">National scholarships</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018105901\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8732:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018105901 and revision id 34857. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}